WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.600
That's why the United States is now applying tariffs

00:02.600 --> 00:04.200
to other countries.

00:04.200 --> 00:07.180
And much as these tariffs were, for many years,

00:07.180 --> 00:11.180
applied to us, uncontrollably applied to us,

00:11.180 --> 00:15.820
we've used tariffs as a defense mechanism

00:15.820 --> 00:19.460
under the Trump administration, including my first term,

00:19.460 --> 00:23.020
where hundreds of billions of dollars in tariffs were taken in.

00:23.020 --> 00:24.700
And by the way, we had the lowest inflation,

00:24.700 --> 00:26.800
and now we have very low inflation.

00:26.800 --> 00:28.800
The only thing different is that we have hundreds

00:28.800 --> 00:30.900
of billions of dollars flowing into our country.

